    group ungrouped
    topic "removalDescription"
    p "Section 29, acts " ["Feb. 17, 1911, ch. 103, § 6" -> "/us/act/1911-02-17/ch103/s6"] ", " ["36 Stat. 915" -> "/us/stat/36/915"] "; " ["Apr. 22, 1940, ch. 124, § 1" -> "/us/act/1940-04-22/ch124/s1"] ", " ["54 Stat. 148" -> "/us/stat/54/148"] "; Oct. 15, 1966, " ["Pub. L. 89–670, § 6(e)(1)(E)" -> "/us/pl/89/670/s6/e/1/E"] ", " ["80 Stat. 939" -> "/us/stat/80/939"] "; Oct. 10, 1980, " ["Pub. L. 96–423, § 13" -> "/us/pl/96/423/s13"] ", " ["94 Stat. 1816" -> "/us/stat/94/1816"] "; June 22, 1988, " ["Pub. L. 100–342, § 14(5)" -> "/us/pl/100/342/s14/5"] ", " ["102 Stat. 633" -> "/us/stat/102/633"] ", related to duties of district inspectors to make railroads inspect and repair locomotive boilers and notify railroads when boilers were not in serviceable condition and provided that railroads could appeal to director of locomotive inspection to have boiler reexamined and could then appeal to Secretary of Transportation if district inspector’s decision was sustained by director. See " ["section 20702 of Title 49" -> "/us/usc/t49/s20702"] "."
