    p "Section 38, acts " ["May 6, 1910, ch. 208, § 1" -> "/us/act/1910-05-06/ch208/s1"] ", " ["36 Stat. 350" -> "/us/stat/36/350"] "; Sept. 13, 1960, " ["Pub. L. 86–762, § 1" -> "/us/pl/86/762/s1"] ", " ["74 Stat. 903" -> "/us/stat/74/903"] "; Oct. 15, 1966, " ["Pub. L. 89–670, § 6(e)(1)(K)" -> "/us/pl/89/670/s6/e/1/K"] ", " ["80 Stat. 939" -> "/us/stat/80/939"] "; June 22, 1988, " ["Pub. L. 100–342, § 15(1)" -> "/us/pl/100/342/s15/1"] ", " ["102 Stat. 633" -> "/us/stat/102/633"] ", related to duty of railroad to make monthly reports of railroad accidents to Secretary of Transportation and defined “railroad” for purposes of sections 38 to 43 of this title. See sections 20102 and 20901 of Title 49."
