    p "Section 40, acts " ["May 6, 1910, ch. 208, § 3" -> "/us/act/1910-05-06/ch208/s3"] ", " ["36 Stat. 351" -> "/us/stat/36/351"] "; Oct. 15, 1966, " ["Pub. L. 89–670, § 6(e)(1)(K)" -> "/us/pl/89/670/s6/e/1/K"] ", " ["80 Stat. 939" -> "/us/stat/80/939"] "; Jan. 3, 1975, " ["Pub. L. 93–633, title III, § 304" -> "/us/pl/93/633/tIII/s304"] ", " ["88 Stat. 2168" -> "/us/stat/88/2168"] "; June 22, 1988, " ["Pub. L. 100–342, § 15(3)" -> "/us/pl/100/342/s15/3"] ", " ["102 Stat. 634" -> "/us/stat/102/634"] ", authorized Secretary of Transportation to investigate railroad accidents, with proviso that Secretary cooperate with State commissions in such investigations if convenient and make reports of such investigations when in the public interest. See " ["section 20902 of Title 49" -> "/us/usc/t49/s20902"] "."
